Implement the changes required for Linear ticket {{ inputs.linear_id }}.

Fetch the ticket details from Linear (title, description, acceptance criteria). Plan the minimal change that satisfies them. Apply the change in this worktree. Write or update tests where the change is testable; run them and confirm they pass before submitting.

Keep the diff focused — no drive-by refactors or unrelated cleanup.

When the work is complete and verified, call {{ submit_tool_name | default('submit') }} exactly once with no arguments — the file mutations are the output.
